-- Receive images from the macOS screenshot location, additional folders and their subfolders, and the optional clipboard watcher.
-- Merge images with identical decoded pixels while their card remains on the line, across tools, folders and clipboard inputs.
-- Preserve private copies of temporary captures before their originating tool removes them.
-- Choose the application used to open an image: the system default, Preview, Shottr, Snapzy, or another application.
-- Chinese and English interface controls, with the upstream localization resources retained.
-- A native menu-bar icon, keyboard shortcut, Quick Look, Markup, and access to open source notices from the menu.
